            <note corresp="#d110-f2" n="2" xml:id="d110-f2-content">
                <p>Telegram 1158, April 3, to London, <hi rendition="#italic">supra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d110-f3" n="3" xml:id="d110-f3-content">
                <p>London’s 73 under reference here is the same as telegram 1330, April. 2, from
